# Testing & quality (Global)

- Tests are **required** when behavior changes.
- Use the repo’s existing test framework and conventions; don’t introduce new frameworks casually.
- Scope tests to what changed: happy path + likely failure path (+ one meaningful edge case if needed).
- If tests are impractical (no harness / heavy setup): provide a concise **Verify** checklist including one negative test.
- Don’t recommend disabling lint/typecheck/test gates; fix root cause or explain tradeoffs.
